WEBVTT

00:00:03.386 --> 00:00:04.200
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 1

00:00:05.249 --> 00:00:06.623
<v><b>A:</b></v> What year was it?

00:00:08.894 --> 00:00:09.662
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 2

00:00:10.378 --> 00:00:11.517
<v><b>A:</b></v> Where were you?

00:00:14.441 --> 00:00:15.220
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 3

00:00:16.092 --> 00:00:17.449
<v><b>A:</b></v> Who were you with?

00:00:19.563 --> 00:00:20.350
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 4

00:00:21.247 --> 00:00:22.809
<v><b>A:</b></v> Where did you have dinner?

00:00:25.065 --> 00:00:25.846
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 5

00:00:26.889 --> 00:00:28.105
<v><b>A:</b></v> What did you wear?

00:00:30.421 --> 00:00:31.345
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 6

00:00:32.203 --> 00:00:34.380
<v><b>A:</b></v> What did you do before midnight?

00:00:36.550 --> 00:00:37.450
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 7

00:00:38.493 --> 00:00:40.371
<v><b>A:</b></v> What did you do at midnight?

00:00:42.685 --> 00:00:43.381
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 8

00:00:44.355 --> 00:00:46.365
<v><b>A:</b></v> What did you do after midnight?

00:00:48.479 --> 00:00:49.320
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 9

00:00:50.157 --> 00:00:51.530
<v><b>A:</b></v> How was the weather?

00:00:53.769 --> 00:00:54.482
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 10

00:00:55.346 --> 00:00:57.246
<v><b>A:</b></v> What time did you go to bed?

00:00:59.437 --> 00:01:00.400
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 11

00:01:01.268 --> 00:01:02.846
<v><b>A:</b></v> Did you have a good time?